			(property "Description" "Chengdu Ebyte E19-915M30S - 915M LoRa (FSK) TRX Using SX1276\n\nThis is a 915 MHz LoRa (or optionally FSK) modulated transciver bassed on the Semtech SX1276. It has a high ouput power of 1W an a pre-installed U.FL connector. Can be used with LoRa WAN with DIO0, DIO1, and DIO2 hooked up to controller interrupt inputs\n\nSparkFun Products:\n\n• SAMD21 Pro RF 1W"
				(at 0 0 0)
				(effects
					(font
						(size 1.27 1.27)
					)
					(hide yes)
				)
			)
			(property "ki_locked" ""
